1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
One ball. One survivor. An entire blood league
between you and the final whistle.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:14,000
This is Blood League: Kickoff.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:24,500
We are Team Huntrix:
Touhidul Alam Seyam and MD. Abtahee Kabir.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:36,000
We created a third-person football-combat roguelite
where your football is the only weapon that can clear the pitch.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Movement, camera control and aiming work together
across a full-sized field.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:59,500
Line up the shot, charge its power, add curve,
and kick through enemy formations.

7
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:10,500
Once the ball leaves your feet, you must survive without it,
reposition, then call it home.

8
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:22,000
Its return path is another attack.
Every kick creates a decision.

9
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Defeated enemies drop blood shards
that level your striker during the match.

10
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:46,500
Active weapons, passive boosts, curses and evolutions
can completely reshape the run.

11
00:01:46,500 --> 00:02:02,000
Six heroes begin with different traits and signature ultimates,
so the same kickoff can lead to a different strategy.

12
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:14,000
This is not football scenery wrapped around a survivor game.
The goal matters.

13
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:27,000
A dedicated defender reads your attacks,
and Count Goalkeeper protects the final objective.

14
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Scoring requires timing, positioning and control
while the enemy wave keeps advancing.

15
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Eleven enemy roles create distinct formations,
supported by elites, minibosses and multi-phase encounters.

16
00:02:51,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Five supernatural stadiums transform the atmosphere
with unique architecture, weather and Blood Moons.

17
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Career progression, unlocks, challenges and custom players
give every kickoff a larger purpose.

18
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:28,000
For us, Kickoff is the first action
that begins an entire journey.

19
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:42,000
One kick launches the combat, the build, the rising pressure,
and the fight toward the final goal.

20
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Kick hard. Call it home. Survive the final whistle.
Blood League: Kickoff, created by Team Huntrix.
